# Hello, Scribium

This document mixes ordinary **Markdown** with Quarkdown-compatible evaluator semantics.

.var {show_extra} {yes}

.if {.show_extra}
    This paragraph is emitted from a boolean-backed conditional.

## Typed value flow

The following expressions are evaluated before Typst lowering:

.string {hello}::concatenate with:{" world"}::capitalize

.sum {20} {22}

.pi::truncate {2}
